	(text "LTR-559ALS-01 application circuit per Lite-On DS86-2013-0003 p.4-5.\nI2C address 0x23. LED_A to VDD (VLED = VDD), LED_K to LDR = internal\nLED driver. C1/C2 1uF X7R, pull-ups 1k-10k per the recommended\ncomponent table; INT is optional (PolyKybd firmware polls)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
